  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The signal&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is given to a NOR gate and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is given to an OR gate. The output of these two signals is given to a NAND gate. Using the laws of Boolean algebra,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi></menclose><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>.</p><p>Analysing from the input graphs, one can see,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
